  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Preview 6: managed system-font paging and shared TTC storage, reusable raster buffers, exact SIMD bilinear sampling, bounded image-brush caches and stale image release. Classic desktop JIT startup prepares common drawing paths on a short-lived background thread; headless applications and Native AOT skip preparation. Reuses exact geometry bounds and glyph coverage buffers. Windows startup white intervals were reduced but not eliminated; original renderer comparisons, CPU/GPU timings, memory, AOT size and remaining quality failures are documented in STARTUP-ROUND7-2026-10-22.md. Steady GPU throughput and resident memory did not improve materially in the latest round. Avalonia remains pinned to 12.1.4; full API/rendering compatibility and macOS GPU remain incomplete.",
